&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW106630119 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW106630119 BCX0&quot;&gt;What makes you a great candidate:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One year minimum work experience providing hands on care&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;OR&lt;/span&gt; Home Health Aide Certificate &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;OR&lt;/span&gt; Certified Nursing Assistant License&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reliable transportation/ability to travel to clients&#39; homes as assigned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for caregiving, providing private in home care, and a desire to help others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possession of qualities like empathy, patience, kindness, and respect.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The commitment to deliver patient care as you would want those you love to be treated, with compassion, excellence, and reliability - The BAYADA Way.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Why you’ll love what you do at BAYADA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;As a mission-driven, not-for-profit organization, we are committed to providing patients the highest-quality care, enabling them to live at home with comfort&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;, independence,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;and dignity. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;And we are just as dedicated to your satisfaction and success. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;89% of employees say they are proud to work for BAYADA!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a member of our home care team, you will be valued, respected, and heard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BAYADA offers the following benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;24/7 on call clinical support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly pay!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Care Field Employees are eligible for any of BAYADA’s group medical, prescription drug, dental, and vision benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;if you work an average of 30 hours per week over a 3-month measurement period&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To learn more about BAYADA Benefits, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bayada.com/benefits/&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible scheduling to fit your lifestyle&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Short commute times – we try to match you to opportunities near your home&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career advancement support including ongoing training and scholarships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A stable working environment – we invest in our care team&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid time off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;24/7 on call clinical support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BAYADA recognizes and rewards our HHAs who set and maintain the highest standards of excellence. Join our caring team today!&lt;/p&gt;
