&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5d8iaj&quot; data-start=&quot;1040&quot; data-end=&quot;1109&quot;&gt;Support field staff in delivering high-quality home care services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;10yey7h&quot; data-start=&quot;1110&quot; data-end=&quot;1221&quot;&gt;Build and maintain strong relationships with clients, referral sources, payors, and community organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1c66yv2&quot; data-start=&quot;1222&quot; data-end=&quot;1326&quot;&gt;Assist with growing office caseload through exceptional customer service and relationship management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1dp7wcs&quot; data-start=&quot;1327&quot; data-end=&quot;1464&quot;&gt;Collaborate with office leadership to monitor operational and financial metrics, including overtime, unfilled hours, and gross margin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1whzy7x&quot; data-start=&quot;1465&quot; data-end=&quot;1534&quot;&gt;Foster positive communication and engagement with field employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1dqfu1e&quot; data-start=&quot;1535&quot; data-end=&quot;1593&quot;&gt;Support employee recognition and retention initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;d2soum&quot; data-start=&quot;1594&quot; data-end=&quot;1667&quot;&gt;Maintain accurate documentation and data entry within company systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1obkcim&quot; data-start=&quot;1669&quot; data-end=&quot;1688&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1689&quot; data-end=&quot;2180&quot;&gt;
