&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;4phubh&quot; data-start=&quot;1721&quot; data-end=&quot;1769&quot;&gt;Home care or healthcare experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16pbifa&quot; data-start=&quot;1770&quot; data-end=&quot;1810&quot;&gt;Customer service experience required&lt;/li&gt;
