&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntc _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnts _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Establish BAYADA as the home care employer and provider of choice in the local market&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntc _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnts _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Manage office performance against key performance indicators, growth goals, service goals, quality expectations, and financial objectives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
