&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnts _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Hire, coach, develop, and retain high-potential office employees and build a strong team culture&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntc _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnts _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Partner with office leaders to support recruiting, onboarding, engagement, and retention of field and office staff&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
