&lt;li&gt;Graduation from an accredited PT program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with EMR systems (training provided)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;❤️ A Culture That Truly Cares&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At BAYADA, you’re part of a mission‑driven organization that values compassion, excellence, and reliability. We’re proud to be recognized as:&lt;/p&gt;
