&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At NiCE, we don’t limit our challenges. We challenge our limits. Always. We’re ambitious. We’re game changers. And we play to win. We set the highest standards and execute beyond them. And if you’re like us, we can offer you the ultimate career opportunity that will light a fire within you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;So, What&#39;s the role all about?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Corporate Strategy team is a small, high-impact group that tackles the company’s most complex business challenges, from market entry decisions and competitive positioning to long-range planning. As a Strategy Analyst Intern, you will work on live strategy projects alongside senior strategists, contribute analysis that reaches the C-suite, and benefit from close mentoring and accelerated development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a passive position. You will own workstreams, defend your findings, and see your work shape real decisions. By the end of your tenure, you will have built a portfolio of strategy deliverables you can speak to directly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How will you make an impact?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your projects will vary, but a typical examples includes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive &amp;amp; Market Intelligence: &lt;/strong&gt;Map the competitive landscape for a strategic initiative, synthesizing findings into an executive-ready brief. Use AI-assisted research tools (e.g., Perplexity, Claude) to accelerate and deepen your analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hypothesis-Driven Problem Solving: &lt;/strong&gt;Structure ambiguous business questions into clear hypotheses, design the analysis to test them, and present actionable recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology &amp;amp; Trend Analysis: &lt;/strong&gt;Monitor and synthesize industry and technology trends including AI and agentic systems to inform NiCE’s strategic positioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Workflow Exploration: &lt;/strong&gt;Experiment with and document generative AI and agentic AI tools to identify opportunities where automated research or analysis pipelines can improve team productivity. This is an emerging and open-ended workstream.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Presentations: &lt;/strong&gt;Translate your analysis into clear, concise presentations delivered to senior leaders including, in some cases, directly to C-suite audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial &amp;amp; Business Modeling: &lt;/strong&gt;Build and stress-test financial models that support investment decisions, partnership evaluations, or build-vs-buy analyses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Have you got what it takes?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently enrolled in a bachelor’s or master’s program with at least 2 years of studies remaining&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong academic record (approximately 85+ average, or equivalent indicator of rigorous academic performance)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Field of study: Business Administration, Economics, Computer Science, Physics, Law, Accounting, Industrial Engineering, or a related analytical discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional analytical and structured thinking abilities. You can turn a messy question into a clear framework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High proficiency in English, written and spoken&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, self-motivated, and comfortable working independently under real deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will have an advantage if you also have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Excel or PowerPoint for analysis and storytelling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI productivity or research tools (ChatGPT, Claude, Copilot, Perplexity, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background or coursework in technology, software, or data-driven fields&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in a strategy, consulting, finance, or research role (internship or student project counts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll gain: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct exposure to corporate strategy at a $2B+ global tech company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentoring from senior strategists and access to NiCE executive leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with modern AI research and productivity tools integrated into real workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio of strategy projects you can speak to in future interviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A fast track to a full-time offer for high performers, many of our analysts started as interns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
